pp":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160456577","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109355#issuecomment-3160456577","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109355","id":3160456577,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68YL2B","user":{"login":"domdfcoding","id":8050853,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNTA4NTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8050853?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding","html_url":"https://github.com/domdfcoding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T14:38:26Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T14:38:26Z","body":"Does it have something to do with the logo being applied to everything but the editor (so it shows up with F5/F6 but not when the editor starts)? The older Godot versions where I got it to work predate the settings being changed to support that, so I guess they ignore the option? But do 4.3 and 4.4 see `boot_splash/image.editor_hint=\"\"` and skip adding the bare file to the pck, since the editor_hint settings apply to the editor.\n\nIf I delete the `boot_splash/image.editor_hint=\"\"` option in project settings with Godot 4.3 the file is in the PCK (according to godotpcktool) alongside the imported texture, and so image shows up correctly in exports. But of course it now shows up then the editor starts, which I didn't want.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160456577/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160954422","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109355#issuecomment-3160954422","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109355","id":3160954422,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68aFY2","user":{"login":"domdfcoding","id":8050853,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNTA4NTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8050853?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding","html_url":"https://github.com/domdfcoding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T17:16:47Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T17:16:47Z","body":"In 4.5 the `splash` variable from line 1021 is the path to the image, but on 4.4.1 it's an empty string. So there is definitely an issue reading the setting.\n\nBut if I call `ProjectSettings::get_singleton()->get_setting(\"application/boot_splash/image\")` I get the correct path (the current code ultimately calls `get_setting_with_override`) . `get_setting_with_override` returns an empty string because it's returning the `application/boot_splash/image.editor_hint` property, when it should be using the appropriate version for the target platform I would think.\n\nI think this works in 4.5 because of #71542, which was fixing a similar issue (#71506) with languages for export targets.\n\nAs this issue requires #85678 to trigger (since you can't set the image for only the editor before then) it only affects 4.3, 4.4 and 4.4.1. I would just document the workaround to import the image with `Keep File` in the documentation for the boot splash image.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160954422/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3183622085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109355#issuecomment-3183622085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109355","id":3183622085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69wjfF","user":{"login":"domdfcoding","id":8050853,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNTA4NTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8050853?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding","html_url":"https://github.com/domdfcoding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/domdfcoding/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-13T12:16:54Z","updated_at":"2025-08-13T12:16:54Z","body":"I opened a draft PR for the docs that notes this bug and the workaround.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3183622085/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]